---
description: Commit messages must not include author or tool trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

Never add author tags or trailers to commits in this repo.

Do not include:
- `Co-authored-by:`
- `Signed-off-by:`
- `Made-with:` / `Made with`
- `Generated-by:` / `Generated with`
- Cursor, Claude, or other tool attribution in the message body or trailers

The commit message is the subject and a short why-focused body only.
